<!-- Báº¢NG TREE GRID PHÃ‚N Cáº¤P 4 Táº¦NG: TRáº NG THÃI -> QUY TRÃŒNH -> TIáº¾N TRÃŒNH -> TODO LIST -->
<div class="table-responsive">
    <table class="table table-bordered text-90 tree-table" id="tblTracking">
        <thead class="bgc-secondary-l1 text-secondary-d2">
            <tr>
                <th style="min-width: 440px;">TÃªn cÃ´ng viá»‡c / Äáº§u má»¥c tiáº¿n trÃ¬nh</th>
